WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.047 --> 00:00:19.562
The queen heard a noise.

2
00:00:19.563 --> 00:00:23.162
"What's that sound?" she asked.

3
00:00:23.163 --> 00:00:26.127
She ran to open the door.

4
00:00:26.128 --> 00:00:30.243
Dirk tumbled into the Royal Bedroom.

5
00:00:30.244 --> 00:00:33.176
He was holding a feather duster.

6
00:00:33.177 --> 00:00:38.695
"Dirk!" cried the queen. "What are you doing?"

7
00:00:38.696 --> 00:00:43.746
Dirk gulped. "I was dusting doors."

8
00:00:43.747 --> 00:00:48.662
The queen frowned. "This isn't dusting day."

9
00:00:48.663 --> 00:00:52.932
Dirk's face turned red. "I was just—"

10
00:00:52.933 --> 00:00:56.087
"Never mind," the king snapped.

11
00:00:56.088 --> 00:00:58.874
"I have a terrible problem.

12
00:00:58.875 --> 00:01:03.766
You must fetch the royal wizard at once!"

13
00:01:03.767 --> 00:01:06.971
"Drat!" Dirk mumbled.

14
00:01:06.972 --> 00:01:13.468
He hurried off.

15
00:01:13.469 --> 00:01:16.480
Tom was in the Royal Kitchen.

16
00:01:16.481 --> 00:01:22.650
He was practicing magic spells.

17
00:01:22.651 --> 00:01:29.071
Dirk ran into the room. "Wizard!" he cried.

18
00:01:29.072 --> 00:01:31.990
He waved his feather duster.

19
00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:37.917
Dust flew everywhere.

20
00:01:37.918 --> 00:01:41.647
"Ah-choo!" Tom sneezed.

21
00:01:41.648 --> 00:01:44.406
"Oh no!" Cook cried.

22
00:01:44.407 --> 00:01:49.735
"Dust is getting in the Royal Soup!"

23
00:01:49.736 --> 00:01:52.900
Tom rushed to help.

24
00:01:52.901 --> 00:01:55.585
"Don't worry, Cook," he said.

25
00:01:55.586 --> 00:01:58.645
"I'll get rid of all the dust!"

26
00:01:58.646 --> 00:02:02.137
Tom waved his wand. Poof!

27
00:02:02.138 --> 00:02:06.286
Splash! Dirk landed in a tub!

28
00:02:06.287 --> 00:02:08.748
"Oops," Tom whispered.

29
00:02:08.749 --> 00:02:14.252
Cat calmly licked her paws.

30
00:02:14.253 --> 00:02:17.245
Cook pulled Dirk out.

31
00:02:17.246 --> 00:02:21.977
"No dust in the Royal Kitchen!" Cook yelled.

32
00:02:21.978 --> 00:02:27.117
Dirk scowled at Tom. "I'll get you one day, Wizard!

33
00:02:27.118 --> 00:02:29.766
But now you must come with me.

34
00:02:29.767 --> 00:02:35.459
The king and queen need you!"
